---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} keywords="Telegram Ads Stars bilan, Stars reklama, Telegram kanal reklama, Buy Ads Telegram, Telegram Ads 30 foiz chegirma" ogType="article" ogImage="https://starsjoy.uz/og-image.png" hreflangs={[
